{"id":"n61035-1-9","stage":5,"title":"불황 · (宏观经济)疲软","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61035-1-9-1","ko":"왜 갑자기 실업자 수가 늘었어?","zh":"为什么失业人数突然增加了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실업자","meaning":"失业者，失业人员","explanation":"실업자：失业者，失业人员","readings":[{"term":"실업자","audio":"/audio/e998f2bfe71a8d5eb4b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91366","senseId":"1","lemma":"실업자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"数","explanation":"수：数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15617","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘었어?","meaning":"增加，上升","explanation":"늘다：增加，上升；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"늘다","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64492","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"e998f2bfe71a8d5e","term":"실업자","zh":"失业者，失业人员","audio":"/audio/e998f2bfe71a8d5eb4b5.mp3","entryId":"91366","definition":"没有工作或失去工作的人。","pronunciation":["시럽짜"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"数","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15617","definition":"计算可数的事物而标示的数目。","pronunciation":["수ː"]},{"id":"0a9915cd5915474e","term":"늘다","zh":"增加，上升","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3","entryId":"64492","definition":"数或量等变得比原来多。","pronunciation":["늘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/da0518e92057dd6030fe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61035-1-9-2","ko":"경기 불황 때문에 회사에서 잘리는 사람들이 많아졌어.","zh":"因为经济不景气，被公司裁掉的人变多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기","meaning":"经济状况","explanation":"경기：经济状况","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25710","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불황","meaning":"(宏观经济)疲软，萧条，不景气","explanation":"불황：(宏观经济)疲软，萧条，不景气","readings":[{"term":"불황","audio":"/audio/6454ac23efa48e64bb1b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61035","senseId":"1","lemma":"불황","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사에서","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘리는","meaning":"被开除","explanation":"잘리다：被开除；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"잘리다","audio":"/audio/24a61c6f3dcfedc40400.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24889","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많아졌어.","meaning":"多，丰富，强；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"经济状况","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"25710","definition":"买卖或交易中表现出的景气与不景气等，与经济领域有关的状况。","pronunciation":["경기"]},{"id":"6454ac23efa48e64","term":"불황","zh":"(宏观经济)疲软，萧条，不景气","audio":"/audio/6454ac23efa48e64bb1b.mp3","entryId":"61035","definition":"社会经济活动不活跃，物价与薪酬降低，生产萎缩，失业率增加的状态。","pronunciation":["불황"]},{"id":"e7ce9cf0ec012e05","term":"때문","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3","entryId":"64555","definition":"表示原因或理由。","pronunciation":["때문"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"24a61c6f3dcfedc4","term":"잘리다","zh":"被开除","audio":"/audio/24a61c6f3dcfedc40400.mp3","entryId":"24889","definition":"被从团体或工作的地方赶走。","pronunciation":["잘리다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b9719bb4bf5dfdc93668.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.578,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61035","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.4047,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["为什么失业人数突然增加了？","因为经济不景气，被公司裁掉的人变多了。","气氛怎么这样？僵得我一句话都不敢说。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["为什么失业人数突然增加了？","因为经济不景气，被公司裁掉的人变多了。","气氛怎么这样？僵得我一句话都不敢说。"],"answer":1}]}
